<title>USA: Yankee Energy names James Sepanski as CFO.</title>
<headline>Yankee Energy names James Sepanski as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>MERIDEN, Conn. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yankee Energy System Inc said Monday it has named James Sepanski chief financial officer replacing Michael Bielonko, who is becoming president of Yankee's Yankee Energy Services Co unit.</p>
<p>The company said Sepanski is a former partner at Arthur Andersen, LLP.</p>
